# NOTE=GBP-VIDEO-002-R4 PHYSICALLY EXECUTED 2026-09-17 with build vstate-0004, one run, no Game Pak. It reached the scientific target again: 1114005 admitted cycles over 175.848 s, of which 120.009 s of VALID post-baseline observation against a 120 s target; stop=nominal_negative, status=ok_structured_change_observed, SERVICE ok, RESTORE ok, transport_ok=1, errors=0, timeouts=0, busy=0, uncertain=0, counter overflows=0. 1114005 unmasks, deliveries, ACKs, re-arms and ISR entries - the five counts are equal - with 1114001 lean cycles and 4 verify. 420073 VIDEO and 720210 AUDIO whole-block drains (1140283 bulk transfers, 268093184 bytes, 4482364 transfers). 0 reentry, 0 main-loop W1C, 1 teardown W1C. 10503 frames (10491 complete, 12 incomplete, 24 resync), baseline valid at 0.077 s, structured change OBSERVED, 9 episodes with 7 stable.
# NOTE=TWENTY-NINE SEMANTIC DISAGREEMENTS, ALL SURVIVED, AND THIS TIME THE DIAGNOSTICS ARE TRUSTWORTHY. All 29 are SOURCE_SERVICED and all 29 are recomputed here directly from their own preserved 32 bytes, without trusting any stored value: Disc 0500, GBI majority 0100, delta 0400, disc_extra 0400 (AUDIO), majority_extra 0000. The service continued; the majority-authoritative policy serviced VIDEO and the omitted AUDIO source was observed in the NEXT ordinary read in 29 of 29 events (next_pending_gbi = next_pending_disc = 0400).
# NOTE=THE vstate-0003 PRODUCER DEFECT (GBP-HW-104) DOES NOT APPEAR HERE. Every record carries the authoritative value, service decision, ACK and re-arm of ITS OWN cycle: authoritative=0100, service_selected=0100, ack=8100 and record_flags=01c1 (SERVICE_WRITTEN | ACK_WRITTEN | REARM_WRITTEN | FOLLOWUP_FILLED) in 29 of 29, with t <= t_ack <= t_rearm <= t_next_cause in 29 of 29. In the v4 file 23 of 23 records had t_ack AFTER t_next_cause and 22 of 23 had an authoritative value that was not the majority; here neither occurs once. The v5 parsers of this repository - C and Python - strict-validate the file, and tools/vstate.py reports ZERO producer warnings.
# NOTE=TIMING MEASURED ON CLOCKS THAT ARE NOW ALL TRUSTWORTHY (tb 40.5 MHz, 29 events): READ->ACK 2600..2756 ticks (64.20..68.05 us), ACK->REARM 828..1445 ticks (20.44..35.68 us), REARM->NEXT CAUSE 77..94 ticks (1.90..2.32 us), READ->NEXT CAUSE 3505..4128 ticks (86.54..101.93 us). These are measurements of this run, not physical bounds, and the internal causality behind them is NOT established: see U-GBP-033.
# NOTE=THIS SCRIPT IS A PREFIX, NOT THE RUN. It carries the 003A stage, the FOUR verify cycles and the teardown - the only parts whose transport operations the log records. The other 1114001 cycles are LEAN by design, so their operations were never written and are NOT invented here. The sidecar is the evidence for them: 10503 frame records, 210 events, 4 episode descriptors, 80 sampled cycles, 15 preserved raw frames, 2 AUDIO blocks and the 29 diagnostics. Header CRC 5baa1a83, total CRC 1e16aee5, both recomputed on analysis; sections exactly contiguous with zero overlap and zero orphan bytes.
# NOTE=REPLICA STRUCTURE, recomputed from the raw bytes of all 29 records: in EVERY event the 0500 replicas form a CONTIGUOUS SUFFIX at the end of the 32-byte window. 24 events have a suffix of length 1, two of length 2 (cycles 113805 and 1030312) and three of length 3 (cycles 941104, 1042937 and 1110826). Across the two long runs the corpus is 52 events, 45/3/4, contiguous in 52 of 52, with AUDIO present in the next read in 52 of 52. That the non-uniformity is ordered rather than scattered is FACT; that the suffix is "the newer value" is NOT established, and the mechanism remains UNKNOWN (U-GBP-033).
